      "entry": 0,
      "title": "Not verified against the supplied roots",
      "explanation": "Trustsmith asked Go's crypto/x509 verifier to validate this certificate against the trust anchors supplied with --roots, and the verifier rejected it. The reason evidence is a stable code, such as no_explicit_anchor_path or certificate_expired. Only the supplied roots were considered: no system trust store was used, and certificates in the inspected input are never anchors themselves.",
      "evidence": [
